## 📅 Core Use Cases & Event Flows

### 1. Workspace Event Scheduling
* **Flow**: A workspace owner clicks **Create Event** in the dashboard and inputs details (Title, Description, Date, Venue, Category, Seat Limit, and Cover Image).
* **Isolation**: The event is created and linked directly to the active workspace ID (`organizationId`).

### 2. Public RSVPs (Attendee Flow)
* **Flow**: Public visitors view published events on the landing page.
* **Registration**: When an unauthenticated user clicks **Register Now**, they are prompted to log in/sign up. Once authenticated, registering creates a `Registration` entry linking their global user ID to the event ID. The seat count updates in real-time.
* **Ticket Management**: The user can view all their confirmed bookings under **My Tickets** in their personal dashboard.
